  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Humanitarian Response to Conflict-Affected Communities in Tawila, North Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Currently, SAHARI, in partnership with CAFOD, is implementing an integrated humanitarian response under the GAC project in Tawila to address urgent needs, and safeguard dignity. The project will complement existing CAG-supported services by supporting nutrition workers and Community Nutrition Volunteers (CNVs), operating one mobile clinic, and rehabilitating two OTP sites.</narrative>
  </description>
